026-04-27T04:09:47Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "not him", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:09:50Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Christopher lee", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:10:01Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: Christopher Lee", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:10:12Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Nikhil: 10, Sayu: 10, Saumay: 10, Sal: 20", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:10:20Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Oh wow, TIL", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:10:43Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "next", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:10:45Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "5.\tBecause the script borrowed so heavily from the 1957 film _Zero Hour_ — entire scenes, dialogue beats, character names, even camera setups — and also referenced beats from the rival Universal’s _Airport_ disaster franchise, Paramount took an unusual step during shooting. They paid a particular kind of consultant to be physically present on set for the entire production, vetting every prop, costume, and line of dialogue as it was filmed, to keep the project on the right side of a particular line. What kind of consultant was this, and what was the consultant looking out for? General funda is enough (10 points).", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:11:12Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Plagiarism consultant", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:11:22Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Intellectual property?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:11:25Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Copyright consultant", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:11:27Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Plagiarism?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:11:40Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "copyright law was the key concept i was looking for", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:12:05Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "There is a standard called “fair use” for parody, the consultant’s job was to make sure everything they did could pass muster under “fair use\"", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:12:26Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Nikhil: 10, Sayu: 10, Saumay: 10, Sal: 30", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]